---
title: System Architecture - Factuality Auditor
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Inter, system-ui, sans-serif"
    primaryColor: "#F8FAFC"
    primaryBorderColor: "#1E293B"
    primaryTextColor: "#1E293B"
    lineColor: "#64748B"
    clusterBkg: "#E2E8F0"
    clusterBorder: "#94A3B8"
---
flowchart LR
    classDef core     fill:#6366F1,stroke:#1E293B,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef data     fill:#10B981,stroke:#1E293B,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef external fill:#F59E0B,stroke:#1E293B,color:#1E293B,stroke-width:1px;

    Answer([Generated answer]):::external

    subgraph Pipeline["Audit pipeline"]
        Extract[Claim extraction]:::core
        Verify[Verification]:::core
        Score[Document scoring]:::core
    end

    KB[(Knowledge base)]:::data
    Calibrate[Calibration: expected calibration error]:::core
    Judgment[["Judgment + calibrated confidence"]]:::core

    Answer -->|sentences| Extract
    Extract -->|claims| Verify
    KB -->|supporting or refuting fact| Verify
    Verify -->|verdicts| Score
    Score --> Judgment
    Score -.->|confidence vs outcome| Calibrate
